    "status": "present",
    "value": "Accepted bookings never overlap, so sorting them by start also sorts them by end. A new interval can only collide with its immediate neighbours in that order: the first booking that starts after the new start, and the booking just before it. Binary search finds the insertion point; check that the successor starts at or after the new end and the predecessor ends at or before the new start. If both hold, insert at that point to keep the lists sorted."
  },
